# Route: guide 36 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 56 to
# 58, 48 quests, 3.5 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Western Plaguelands, Eastern Plaguelands, Tirisfal Glades, Burning
# Steppes, Tanaris, Un'Goro Crater, Feralas): Northridge Lumber Camp ->
# Felstone Field -> Ruins of Andorhal -> Sorrow Hill -> Ruins of Andorhal ->
# Northridge Lumber Camp -> Thondroril River -> Light's Hope Chapel -> Corin's
# Crossing -> Light's Hope Chapel -> The Undercroft -> The Bulwark -> Ruins of
# Thaurissan -> ….
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the
# Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors
# (5515), Of Love and Family (5848), Oculus Illusions (6569), Dawn's Gambit
# (4771), The Flesh Does Not Lie (5212), The Active Agent (5213), The Great
# Fras Siabi (5214), Houses of the Holy (5243), The Archivist (5251), Above
# and Beyond (5263), The Restless Souls (5282), Menethil's Gift (5463),
# Plagued Hatchlings (5529), Ramstein (6163), Dead Man's Plea (8945),
# Anthion's Old Friend (8948), Vorrel's Revenge (1051), Barov Family Fortune
# (5341), The Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), The Wrath of Rath'mael (92422),
# Crest of Lordaeron (95204), Unending Torment (97288), Dark Iron Legacy
# (3802), A Taste of Flame (4024), Precarious Predicament (4121), The Heart of
# the Mountain (4123), Egg Freezing (4734), Egg Collection (4735),
# Divino-matic Rod (2768), Scarab Shells (2865), Troll Temper (3042), Into the
# Depths (3446), Secret of the Circle (3447), The Prophecy of Mosh'aru (3527),
# The God Hakkar (3528), The Final Tablets (4788), Pusillin and the Elder
# Azj'Tordin (7441), Elven Legends (7481), Lethtendris's Web (7489).

